    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "A Fabulous Country Home on c.0.80 acre at Ringlestown, Kilmessan, Co Meath A 4 Bedroom Detached Bungalow Residence, its origins was a Traditional Land Commission Cottage on 22 Acres, evolved into a spacious and comfortable Bungalow in 1970's on an elevated site enjoying great views from front terrace over surrounding countryside. A Mature Private Property 2 Km from Kilmessan Village (Supermarket, National School, Station House Hotel & Monto's Restaurants & A Butchers Shop, 6 minutes from M3 Motorway and about 15 minutes to Navan, Trim and Dunshaughlin, adjacent to Royal Tara Golf Club & Hill of Tara. Originally a working Farm, having lots of outbuildings, additional lands available by separate negotiation"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance hallway, spacious Living Room with an open fireplace, Sitting Room/Dining Room with two Windows facing west with great views over countryside, Fully fitted Solid Wood Kitchen with an everyday Dining area, rear hallway, 4 Double Bedrooms, a Family Bathroom and a Laundry Room.\r\nOutside has a hardcore driveway, Car parking spaces for 10+ Cars, a Row of Outbuildings suitable for storage, garden or Hobby use, front side and rear gardens, mature trees and shrubs"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Private Detached Family Home on 0.80 acre in a fabulous area close to all amenities, with great views over surrounding countryside, very well maintained and having 4 double bedrooms, 2 Reception Rooms, and a fitted Kitchen/Dining Room, Utility, Family Bathroom. A row of Outbuildings, Tree lined boundaries, lawns, shrubs and plenty of parking"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: D1"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Directions",
        "SortOrder": 5,
        "Content": "From Dunshaughlin travel towards Navan, turn left before Motorway to Royal Tara Golf Club, take a left for Kilmessan and travel about 2 kilometres and Ringlestown  is on left hand side. C15 RY74"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Viewing Details",
        "SortOrder": 6,
        "Content": "Only by prior appointment and highly recommended"
      }
    ],
